OL,3,GNEWSASean Graham bookmakers memorial
OL,4,Asprayed with paint for second time
OL,5,
OL,6,FPortraits of those murdered in the Sean
OL,7,FGraham bookmakers shootings have been
OL,8,Fremoved from a memorial after they were
OL,9,Fdamaged by spray paint.
OL,11,FPolice have launched an investigation
OL,12,Ffollowing damage to the memorial
OL,13,Fdedicated to those who were killed. It
OL,14,Fis being treated as a sectarian
OL,15,Fmotivated offence.
OL,17,FFive people were murdered in the Ulster
OL,18,FDefence Association (UDA) attack on the
OL,19,FOrmeau Road in south Belfast in 1992.
OL,20,FSeven other people were injured.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
