OL,3,GNEWSASean Graham bookmakers memorial
OL,4,Asprayed with paint for second time
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,7,F(PSNI) is investigating a potential
OL,8,Flink between Thursday's incident and a
OL,9,Freport of criminal damage at the
OL,10,Fmemorial in September.
